  "title": "Comparison of a minimizer in A with a cycle pushed into A by a near-isometric C¹ retraction (Simon 7.2.4 (9) with Remark 7.2.5(2))",
  "statement": "Let P, m ∈ ℕ, n := m + 1, U ⊆ ℝ^P open, A ⊆ ℝ^P, and S ∈ 𝒟_n(U) minimizing in A (IsMinimizingIn S A) with spt S ⊆ A. Let G > 0 with closedBall(0, G) ⊆ U, and L ≥ 0. Let π : ℝ^P → ℝ^P be C¹ on B_{2G}(0), with π(B_{2G}(0)) ⊆ A, π(y) = y for y ∈ A ∩ B_{2G}(0), and |π(y)| ≤ 2|y| and |π(y) − π(z)| ≤ L|y − z| for y, z ∈ B_{2G}(0). Let Y ∈ 𝒟_n(ℝ^P) be integer multiplicity with ∂Y = 0, spt Y compact and spt Y ⊆ B_{G/2}(0). Then M_{B_G(0)}(S) ≤ Lⁿ·M_{B_G(0)}(S + Y). Here S + Y ∈ 𝒟_n(U) means S − (0 − Y|_U), with Y|_U := Y.restrictDomain (U ⊆ ℝ^P), and Lⁿ is read as ENNReal.ofReal (L^n).",
  "lean_statement": "∀ (P m : ℕ) (U A : Set (Euclid P)) (S : GeometricCurrentOn U (m + 1)) (Y : GeometricCurrentOn (univ : Set (Euclid P)) (m + 1)) (π : Euclid P → Euclid P) (G L : ℝ), IsOpen U → IsMinimizingIn S A → S.support ⊆ A → 0 < G → closedBall (0 : Euclid P) G ⊆ U → 0 ≤ L → ContDiffOn ℝ 1 π (ball 0 (2 * G)) → MapsTo π (ball 0 (2 * G)) A → (∀ y ∈ A ∩ ball 0 (2 * G), π y = y) → (∀ y ∈ ball 0 (2 * G), ‖π y‖ ≤ 2 * ‖y‖) → (∀ y ∈ ball 0 (2 * G), ∀ z ∈ ball 0 (2 * G), ‖π y - π z‖ ≤ L * ‖y - z‖) → IsIntegerMultiplicity Y → Y.boundary = 0 → IsCompact Y.support → Y.support ⊆ ball 0 (G / 2) → S.massOn (ball 0 G) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (L ^ (m + 1)) * (S - (0 - Y.restrictDomain (subset_univ U))).massOn (ball 0 G)",
